<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Holderbank.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Holderbank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 30 million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of Holderbank.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,550 CHF		 PREMIUM	17.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.64 CHF		  GEARING	8.9 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.JUL.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	18.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,463 CHF</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
